      "text": "1. Starts with \"--\"? No\n2. validate_and_add(\"2\", &cfg):\n   • sign = +1, num = 2\n   • 2 <= INT_MAX (OK)\n3. append_node(&stack_a, 2):\n   • has_duplicate([1], 2) -> 0\n   • malloc(t_node) -> val=2, idx=-1\n   • Links: [1]->next=[2], [2]->prev=[1]",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Starts with \"--\"? No\n2. validate_and_add(\"2\", &cfg):\n   • sign = +1, num = 2\n   • 2 <= INT_MAX (OK)\n3. append_node(&stack_a, 2):\n   • has_duplicate([1], 2) -> 0\n   • malloc(t_node) -> val=2, idx=-1\n   • Links: [1]->next=[2], [2]->prev=[1]",
