      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Starts with \"--\"? No\n2. validate_and_add(\"4\", &cfg):\n   • sign = +1, num = 4\n   • 4 <= INT_MAX (OK)\n3. append_node(&stack_a, 4):\n   • has_duplicate([1,2], 4) -> 0\n   • Walks curr: [1] -> [2]\n   • Links: [2]->next=[4], [4]->prev=[2]",
